Encoder Substitution: To evaluate alternative encoder designs, we replace the tabular encoder of RAN-MP-Core with TPBERTa [40] and its time-series encoder with either TTMs [5] (TPB-TTMs) or TimeMixer [37] (TPB-TM), keeping the rest of the architecture and training pipeline identical (Sections 3.3 and 3.5). TPBERTa and TTMs are single-modality models pretrained on large-scale cross-domain data; in TPB-TTMs, both encoders are fine-tuned from their pretrained initialization, whereas TPB-TM is trained from random initialization.

